      <title>从SEO转向GEO：开发者如何让网站被AI搜索准确理解</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260904/%E4%BB%8ESEO%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91GEO%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%AE%A9%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E8%A2%ABAI%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3/</link>
